OL,3,GNEWSACouple lived next door to dead
OL,4,Abody for six weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dead body lay undiscovered next door
OL,7,Fto the home of an elderly couple for
OL,8,Fsix weeks despite them raising
OL,9,Frepeatedly raising concerns.
OL,11,FAlison and Ray Mitchell, who live in
OL,12,FDonaldson Court, Worcester, said they
OL,13,Ffirst noticed a foul smell in the
OL,14,Fmiddle of June, before flies started
OL,15,Fappearing around their neighbour's
OL,16,Fwindow.
OL,18,FThe body was eventually found around a
OL,19,Fmonth after they first reported their
OL,20,Fconcerns to West Mercia Police, with
OL,21,FAlison, 70, describing the situation as
OL,22,F"upsetting".
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
