OL,3,GNEWSACouple lived next door to dead
OL,4,Abody for six weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the police force
OL,7,Fsaid they used information reported to
OL,8,Fthem to "determine whether the police
OL,9,Fare the most appropriate service to
OL,10,Frespond".
